iroh is a tool-only package. It installs these executables under tools/iroh:

    iroh-dns-server
    iroh-relay

Vcpkg adds this directory to PATH for consumers. There is no CMake target and
no standalone `iroh` CLI binary in the v1.5.0 release.

On Linux, triplets whose name contains "musl" install the musl release assets;
all other Linux triplets install the gnu release assets.
